<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Guillaume, Grand Duke of Luxembourg</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">born 1981</span> · <a href="/centuries/21st-century">21st century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Guillaume is Grand Duke of Luxembourg, having succeeded his father Henri on Henri's abdication in October 2025. Born in 1981, the eldest son of Henri and Maria Teresa, he was educated in Luxembourg, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/switzerland">Switzerland</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>, trained at Sandhurst, and served as his father's lieutenant-representative from 2024. He married Countess Stéphanie de Lannoy in 2012.</p></div>
